- The name can contain letters, digits, Chinese characters, hyphens (-), underscores (_), and periods (.). The name cannot start or end with a hyphen, underscore, or period.
- The name must be unique among resource export tasks within the current account.', example='TaskName', position='Body'),
  ramRole?: string(name='ramRole', description='The RAM role.', example='ramName', position='Body'),
  terraformProviderVersion?: string(name='terraformProviderVersion', description='The Terraform provider version. Call **ListTerraformProviderVersions** to view the supported versions. Default value: the latest version.', example='1.183.0', position='Body'),
  terraformVersion?: string(name='terraformVersion', description='The Terraform version. Call **ListAvailableTerraformVersions** to view the supported versions. Default value: 1.5.7.', example='1.5.7', position='Body'),
  triggerStrategy?: string(name='triggerStrategy', description='The trigger strategy. Valid values:
- Auto: triggered automatically when rules are modified or the trigger strategy is changed to Auto.
